P","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/@south_county_resistancechariho_chapter__ri"},{"__typename":"Group","avatar":{"__typename":"Media","id":"7c87878f-80d8-414e-b0a2-a87ab08a25e2","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/media/f35cd0f2301126bc47c19e3f0f2dd820d83598ca4f79fb709ff25ea4aa507f90.webp?name=shutdown315%27s%20avatar.webp"},"banner":{"__typename":"Media","id":"4b898d1c-e961-4018-a8ac-cde0f0309c33","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/media/bf2838f377d2f65cc5e852f31c81311a47aa5a8f5e1572d19d0d7e38901b5318.jpg?name=shutdown315%27s%20banner.jpg"},"domain":null,"followersCount":2,"id":"55034","membersCount":1,"name":"SHUTDOWN315","physicalAddress":{"__typename":"Address","country":"United States","description":"United States","geom":"-100.445882;39.7837304","id":"794","locality":null,"originId":null,"pictureInfo":null,"postalCode":null,"region":null,"street":null,"timezone":"America/Chicago","type":null,"url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/address/eef61400-b968-4093-92d4-6ccc5cdca87e"},"preferredUsername":"shutdown315","summary":"<p dir=\"auto\">Join shutdown315, a free will movement advocating for economic non-participation. We believe in prioritizing people over profits, urging the U.S. government to serve its citizens, not corporations. Stand with us for a better future where the power lies with the people!</p>","type":"GROUP","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/@shutdown315"},{"__typename":"Group","avatar":{"__typename":"Media","id":"1540f41f-9f33-4fe2-a32a-205381f48909","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/media/d44b4c8417f5e0f951f36a96a2eb94ce03bf3253521c6f06c083558e773a111c.png?name=50501_chicago%27s%20avatar.png"},"banner":null,"domain":null,"followersCount":1,"id":"50460","membersCount":1,"name":"50501 Chicago","physicalAddress":{"__typename":"Address","country":"United States","description":"Chicago","geom":"-87.6244212;41.8755616","id":"746","locality":null,"originId":null,"pictureInfo":null,"postalCode":null,"region":"Illinois","street":null,"timezone":"America/Chicago","type":null,"url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/address/40396ce3-5726-41e8-8946-a83552e146ff"},"preferredUsername":"50501_chicago","summary":"<p>Peaceful nonviolent protest focused on eliminating Executive Branch overreach and restoration of Constitutional separation of powers</p>","type":"GROUP","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/@50501_chicago"},{"__typename":"Group","avatar":{"__typename":"Media","id":"3d72257b-711f-4f9b-8751-394010fe1671","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/media/405cd556a2d23845314e64f6057d1d95770f081d5ba468469a8e676632e78adb.png?name=wethepeopleofdallas%27s%20avatar.png"},"banner":null,"domain":null,"followersCount":0,"id":"46528","membersCount":1,"name":"We The People of Dallas","physicalAddress":{"__typename":"Address","country":"United States","description":"Dallas","geom":"-96.7968559;32.7762719","id":"689","locality":null,"originId":null,"pictureInfo":null,"postalCode":null,"region":"Texas","street":null,"timezone":"America/Chicago","type":null,"url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/address/c8782c3f-43eb-4eab-b3e7-9eb7628d8f48"},"preferredUsername":"wethepeopleofdallas","summary":"<p>We the people of Dallas—a city built on resilience, grit, and the spirit of independence—stand together to defend the values that make our democracy strong. Texas has always been a place of bold ideas and determined people, a land where voices shape the future and where courage runs as deep as the roots of our live oaks.</p><p>At a time when division threatens to weaken the foundation of our freedoms, we choose unity. We choose action. We choose to protect the right of every Texan to have a say in the future of our great state and country.</p><p>This group is more than a gathering place—it is a movement. A movement of neighbors, workers, students, parents, and leaders who believe that democracy is not just something we inherit but something we must fight to preserve. Whether it’s standing up for fair elections, ensuring every vote is counted, or holding those in power accountable, we are here to make a difference.</p>","type":"GROUP","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/@wethepeopleofdallas"},{"__typename":"Group","avatar":{"__typename":"Media","id":"bdd07e0c-c0a5-4ee7-a1c2-37312acf08a4","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/media/1ed9c6573cd4e441be165858757af96c96c8bda2090719db2bc79ff2839b7231.png?name=50501albuquerque_%27s%20avatar.png"},"banner":null,"domain":null,"followersCount":2,"id":"45217","membersCount":1,"name":"50501-Albuquerque ","physicalAddress":{"__typename":"Address","country":"United States","description":"Albuquerque","geom":"-106.650985;35.0841034","id":"651","locality":null,"originId":null,"pictureInfo":null,"postalCode":null,"region":"New Mexico","street":null,"timezone":"America/Denver","type":null,"url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/address/3a287d39-20d9-4027-a54c-3070ccfc90f8"},"preferredUsername":"50501albuquerque_","summary":"<p dir=\"auto\">I’m here to help promote 50501 protests in Albuquerque. I don’t know what I’m doing but will figure it out.  If you’d like to help please contact.</p><p dir=\"auto\"></p>","type":"GROUP","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/@50501albuquerque_"},{"__typename":"Group","avatar":null,"banner":null,"domain":null,"followersCount":0,"id":"45212","membersCount":1,"name":"50501 California","physicalAddress":{"__typename":"Address","country":"United States","description":"California State Capitol","geom":"-121.4934010890531;38.57656885","id":"647","locality":"Sacramento","originId":null,"pictureInfo":null,"postalCode":"95814","region":"California","street":"1315 10th Street","timezone":"America/Los_Angeles","type":null,"url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/address/a33fe68e-aa06-43ea-a6bb-60a0ed1a93a0"},"preferredUsername":"50501_california","summary":"<p>California based 50501 group</p>","type":"GROUP","url":"https://events.pol-rev.com/@50501_california"},{"__typename":"Group","avatar":null,"banner":{"__typename":"Media","id":"69fc8838-47e5-47d7-8899-d9e5fcca23f4","url":"https://events.pol